dvbipitools (2.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium
  * added optional metrics export to the following tools:
    + dipirec
    + dipidescramble
    + dipicam378
    + dipifccret
  * dvbipitools / "dipi" multicall binary
  * ipk: armv7ahf -> armv7ahf-neon flagging for broader compatibility
  * fixed kernel payload confusion on multiple mcast inputs using the same port
  * added a warning about known problems when using librist v0.2.20 and below with IPv6
  * merged dipisrt branch - no srt support in other tools until it stabilized
    + bonding depends on libsrt having it enabled (not by default)
  * fixed EIT race in mpts remuxer (corrupted eit+crc32)
  * overrides for EMMG max conns and EMMC max services
  * rist:// single-peer input support (output already existed) at:
    + dipitvhead
    + dipirec
    + dipidescramble
    note: librist only supports 1 rist connection per process.
  * srt:// single-peer/no-rendevouz input+output support at:
    + dipitvhead
    + dipirec
    + dipidescramble
  * new: dipixy
    + multicast/RIST/SRT to HLS/LL-HLS/HLS-TS/HLS-FMP4/DASH/LL-DASH/Progressive (SP|MP)TS
    + DLNA/UPnP-AV (~DVB-HN)
  * picohttpparser
  * dipiscan: CIDR, multiple jets
 -- dvbipitools authors <unspecified@example.com>  Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0200

dvbipitools (2.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium
  * merged dipirist sender and receiver
  * dipirec replay to multicast
  * rist branch: output for:
    + dipitvhead
    + dipiradiohead
    + dipirec
  * dipifccret
    + added/mapped (some) missing status code handlers
    + rsi self announcement (F 5.3)
    + per-session sequence numbers
  * dipidescramble ecm_profile
  * dipibcg: optional zlib compression
    + fixed a flagging error on the way
  * dipitvhead + dipiradiohead: support for parallel outputs
  * support multiple parallel outputs in dipirec and dipidescramble
    mirrors dipi*head's output behavior
  * ported rtmp(s)/flv container support
    + dipirec rtmp(s) output
    + dipidescramble rtmp(s) output
    + automatically switches to enhanced rtmp if the codecs need it
  * linking of optional dependencies moved to dlopen()
  * hardened httpclient's chunk parser
  * getaddrinfo() resilience (handle stalls after EINPROGRESS)
  * added monotonic absolute deadlines to 2 possibly stalling poll()s
  * dipicam378/cs378x: stop/join workers before free; bounded reply send for slow clients
  * dipisds support for Package Discovery, Regionalisation Discovery, RMS-FUS Discovery record types
  * -d|--daemonize param on most tools
  * make install
  * man pages
  * marged port of dipirec-style --strip to dipitvhead
  * udpxy inputs replaced by generic http(s) tspush_client
  * OpenATV opkg .ipk packaging
 -- dvbipitools authors <unspecified@example.com>  Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0200

dvbipitools (2.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium
  * dipiradiohead: same CAS treatment as dipitvhead
  * dipitvhead:
    + moved out common components to lib/cas/
    + --cas-pids usability improvements
  * perf track w32 findings (that were not _that_ performance related at all this time):
    + CAS_CORE_MAX_PIDS > 15 didn't scramble (>15)
    + dipifccret:
      - discard unused channels fixed
      - O(N) channel_lookup is off the (hash-)table
    + httpclient.c resiliency: didn't have our own timeout enforcement
    + some minor "snprintf() concat has no place on a hot path" hunting
  * merged 2nd (and largest) part of Multi-Program TS scripts & tools (writers)
    + multiple concurrent inputs in dipiradiohead & dipitvhead -> MPTS writer
    + 2 steps forward, 1 back for proper non-blocking states on opening client contrib conns ... and back again
  * fixed charset mapping bug in dipiradiohead's EIT tagger
  * dipifccret: direct TPACKET_V3 and BPF instead of pcap
  * dipisds and dipiepg: reload source/mapping files on SIGHUP
  * deduplication of args parsers, ts packers and section assembly
  * fixed double-memcpy in dipi*head
  * dipiepg renamed to dipibcg (ETSI TS 102 539 calls it Broadcast Content Guide, not EPG)
  * MPTS and CAS needed better metrics for testing = priority lane for OpenMetrics
    + welcome dipimetrics collector, providing a per-host HTTP /metrics Prometheus endpoint
  * consolidating metrics opened the next door: multi-cas reporting
    + so, initial multi-cas support also found its way to dipitvhead and dipiradiohead (merge complete)
  * http_client lib: chunked support
  * deb package: dynamic linking instead of static; dipiradiohead/dipitvhead/dipidescramble (tar.gz stays static)
  * BISS1 and BISS2 support (excl. BISS1-E and BISS2-CA group keys)
  * legacy CSA(1) support (mostly added signaling)
  * explicit logging/metrics for previously silent drops/clamping
  * fixed scrambler "full queue" segfault (mpts long-run test loop finding)
  * fixed dipidescramble ECM resolution in (partially) scrambled mpts
  * dipirec: added --pace and file+stdin input for burstless "-o -" replay
  * dipirec: changed hardcoded stripper to "--strip NUL,AIT,EIT,..."
    + note: defaults, if not set, changed to keep CAT,ECM,EMM (if present)
 -- dvbipitools authors <unspecified@example.com>  Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0200

